OL,3,GNEWSA#250k seized from activist facing
OL,4,Aterror charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has emerged that Leicestershire
OL,7,FPolice seized assets worth over a
OL,8,Fquarter of a million pounds from a man
OL,9,Faccused of committing terrorist
OL,10,Foffences on social media.
OL,12,FMajid Novsarka from Leicester, who is
OL,13,Falso known as Majid Freeman, has denied
OL,14,Ftwo charges and is due to go on trial
OL,15,Fnext year.
OL,17,FDetails of the seizures are set out in
OL,18,Fa court document in a case which has
OL,19,Fbeen listed for a magistrate's hearing
OL,20,Fin November.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
